<!-- FAQ -->
<section class="faq-section" id="faq">
  <div class="faq-container">
    <div class="faq-header reveal">
      <span class="section-label">Got Questions?</span>
      <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked <span class="highlight">Questions</span></h2>
      <p class="section-sub">Everything you need to know about personal branding in Ras Al Khaimah and the UAE.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-list reveal">

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">What personal branding services do you offer in Ras Al Khaimah?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>TamkinExpress provides end-to-end personal branding for Ras Al Khaimah professionals — covering brand strategy and positioning, visual identity design, LinkedIn profile optimisation, content creation in English and Arabic, UAE media and PR placements, and monthly performance analytics.</p>
          <p>All services are managed in-house by our UAE-based team with no outsourced freelancers — ensuring your brand voice stays consistent, your timelines are always met, and your strategy evolves with your professional goals and RAK's changing market.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">How does personal branding help professionals and entrepreneurs in Ras Al Khaimah?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Ras Al Khaimah is attracting significant international investment and is undergoing one of the most notable economic transformations of any UAE emirate — driven by the Al Marjan Island resort development, RAKEZ's growing free zone ecosystem, and expanding real estate and tourism sectors. A growing share of business decisions now begin with a LinkedIn or Google search, and RAK professionals who are visible and credible in those channels win opportunities that never enter the traditional referral circuit.</p>
          <p>A strong personal brand ensures that when a client, investor, or procurement head in Dubai, Abu Dhabi, Sharjah, or internationally searches for expertise in your field, your name and credentials surface first — generating inbound opportunities without cold outreach.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">How long does it take to build a personal brand in Ras Al Khaimah?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>We launch your complete personal brand — strategy, visual identity, LinkedIn optimisation, and your first content library in English and Arabic — within 6 weeks. Most clients begin seeing measurable results such as increased LinkedIn profile views, new inbound connections from target clients, and fresh enquiries within the first 90 days.</p>
          <p>Building deep, sustained authority in your RAK sector is a 6–12 month journey. Our team provides ongoing content, media outreach, and strategic refinement to ensure your brand continues growing every single month.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">Do you create Arabic content for professionals in Ras Al Khaimah?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Yes. Ras Al Khaimah has a strong Emirati identity and a significant Arabic-speaking professional and business community. For many RAK business owners and executives, reaching Emirati and Arab decision-makers in Arabic is not optional — it is essential. We build fully bilingual personal brand strategies in English and Arabic so your content resonates across the full breadth of RAK's professional market and the wider UAE.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">Which industries in Ras Al Khaimah benefit most from personal branding?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Personal branding generates strong results for RAK professionals across the emirate's key sectors: RAKEZ free zone entrepreneurs and importers, tourism and hospitality executives, manufacturing and ceramics industry leaders, real estate developers and brokers, healthcare and medical professionals, education and training providers, financial services consultants, and SME business owners across professional services and retail.</p>
          <p>If your business growth depends on trust, reputation, and professional expertise — personal branding directly accelerates that growth. We tailor every strategy to your specific sector, target audience, and goals within Ras Al Khaimah and the broader UAE market.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">What platforms do you use for personal branding in RAK?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>LinkedIn is our primary platform for most RAK professionals — it is where UAE decision-makers, procurement teams, and investors evaluate professional credibility before making business decisions. Depending on your industry and target audience, we also build presence on Instagram, X (Twitter), YouTube, personal websites, and through SEO-optimised content that surfaces in both Google search and AI-powered search tools.</p>
          <p>For RAK's tourism and hospitality professionals, Instagram plays a particularly strong secondary role alongside LinkedIn — reaching consumers, media, and international travel investors. We tailor your platform mix to where your specific audience is most active and most likely to act.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">Do I need to write or post content myself?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>No. Our content and ghostwriting team handles everything — creation, scheduling, LinkedIn engagement, and community management — entirely on your behalf. A brief monthly alignment call is typically all the time you need to invest.</p>
          <p>Every piece of content we create is written in your voice, reflecting your genuine expertise, professional perspective, and personality — so your audience always experiences an authentic and credible presence, even when you are fully focused on running your business in Ras Al Khaimah.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">What is the cost of personal branding services in Ras Al Khaimah?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Personal branding packages at TamkinExpress are tailored to each professional's goals, sector, target audience, and the scale of activity required. We offer a free brand audit and consultation to assess your current digital presence, identify your biggest opportunities, and recommend the right approach for your objectives in Ras Al Khaimah and the wider UAE.</p>
          <p>Contact us to book your free consultation — there is no obligation, and you will leave with a clear picture of what a structured personal brand can do for your career or business in RAK.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

      <div class="faq-item">
        <button class="faq-question" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="faq-q-text">Do you serve clients across all UAE emirates, including Ras Al Khaimah?</span>
          <span class="faq-icon"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="2.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline></svg></span>
        </button>
        <div class="faq-answer"><div class="faq-answer-inner">
          <p>Yes. We serve professionals across all seven UAE emirates — Abu Dhabi, Dubai, Sharjah, Ajman, Umm Al Quwain, Ras Al Khaimah, and Fujairah. All services are available fully remotely, so geography is never a barrier to building a powerful personal brand.</p>
          <p>For Ras Al Khaimah clients who prefer an in-person onboarding session, we are happy to arrange a meeting at a convenient location in RAK or at our Abu Dhabi office.</p>
        </div></div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

